.env
*.tmp
*.log
# NOTE: seen.json / drops.json / HISTORY.md are intentionally committed —
# they are the persistent state, versioned in the repo.
#
# node_modules is ALSO intentionally committed (vendored). Deps are pure-JS
# (dotenv + playwright's JS; the browser lives in the CI container image), so
# CI needs zero installs and runs instantly. Re-vendor after changing deps:
#   rm -rf node_modules && PLAYWRIGHT_SKIP_BROWSER_DOWNLOAD=1 \
#     npm ci --no-audit --no-fund --ignore-scripts && rm -rf node_modules/fsevents
